        "circulation": "西socket(0,1,6)final bottom smooth_stone_slab到y1泥砖前场；(3,2,6)air→门→(5,2/3,6)air长室，南西箱(2,2,9)east保留原weaponsmith loot/seed。原碰撞与火源可达未验。",
